  {
   "rating": 12,
   "date": "2026-09-23T11:14:58-05:00",
   "body": "The elementals book drops off named kobold named Nimsy (not the other one named Goldtooth). Enter in the top entrance of the mine, and from the large room in the mine, go east and curve north up the stairs. He's up there with some henchmen. Probably can't solo at appropriate level.",
   "replies": [
    "As difficult as it is, it's possible to solo around level 7-8 if work with the new early profession gear with some classes. Examples I've done at level 7 are a Shaman, Paladin, and Hunter.",
    "This is a VERY challenging fight as he'll summon an elemental as well so keep that in mind."
   ]
  },
